{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>「最美繼母」楊卓娜（Lenna）與妹妹楊茜堯（前名：楊怡）同為娛圈中人，雖然知名度不及妹妹，但楊卓娜依然活得精彩。楊卓娜與身家千萬的「燈箱大王」楊志翹相愛18年，為對方誕下愛女，又視兩名繼女視如己出，雖然兩人至今未有正式註冊，但早已以夫妻相稱。楊卓娜近年復出做直播帶貨，更以VIP身份飛到巴黎，一口氣狂掃LV、CHANEL以及DIOR等手袋。飛完東京掃貨後，楊卓娜孖楊志翹飛西藏睇三大聖湖之一「羊卓雍錯（羊湖）」，兩人形影不離，非常甜蜜！</p><figure><img alt=\"楊卓娜與老公楊志翹感情相當好。（IG：@lennayeung）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250123/959110206091038720790642.jpeg/axx8VTsW4IdL_OjGGxHH8kqPJo9P0YUsLDK5hiwyuYY\"/><figcaption>楊卓娜與老公楊志翹感情相當好。（IG：@lennayeung）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"楊卓娜與「燈箱大王」楊志翹抱起妹妹楊茜堯一對子女。（IG：@lennayeung）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250201/962396391001296896039654.jpeg/nuh_FwIhtHS7o2_Lac7jjKaBu7tS2SP9CKqUpwiqlKc\"/><figcaption>楊卓娜與「燈箱大王」楊志翹抱起妹妹楊茜堯一對子女。（IG：@lennayeung）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"楊卓娜現身巴黎，她更留言：「老佛爺頂層嘅VIP房風景真係非同小可，可以想像，藍天白雲嘅日子真係靚到癲咗。」（IG/@lennayeung）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20251025/1058792491844636672506917.jpeg/CD3dsmYpSbQ0tu7tsTynGOtQk1n796WWqNvXPqjb1z4\"/><figcaption>楊卓娜現身巴黎，她更留言：「老佛爺頂層嘅VIP房風景真係非同小可，可以想像，藍天白雲嘅日子真係靚到癲咗。」（IG/@lennayeung）</figcaption></figure><p>楊卓娜孖男友楊志翹西藏拍拖睇羊湖</p><p>楊卓娜在Instagram限時動態分享到西藏旅行的片段。從片段中可見，楊卓娜與楊志翹今次是自駕遊，楊志翹負責揸車，楊卓娜拍下男友揸車的片段，十分恩愛。其後兩人終於到達羊湖，成個羊湖只有楊卓娜和楊志翹，任影都得。</p><figure><img alt=\"楊卓娜與家人預祝生日。（IG圖片）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20251110/1064591344690794496935687.png/2l8GwI9xWN8ISyIkL-9y4_lIu__HvPfjPgW3Gz4Ftxs\"/><figcaption>楊卓娜與家人預祝生日。（IG圖片）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"楊卓娜愛掃貨！（抖音截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260511/1130578306706706432359876.png/LD_ZsxkzSZp1otwR98HA4HENXZPrsgIyos5O2aLOTtk\"/><figcaption>楊卓娜愛掃貨！（抖音截圖）</figcaption></figure><p>楊卓娜同楊志翹在羊湖前舉高雙手影相，楊卓娜嘆道：「往魯日拉看羊湖，一日四季，說風就是雨，說雨便是雪！大自然的風景，不光是『看』，更多的是『悟』！」楊志翹手持咖啡，一派輕鬆，又同楊卓娜一齊盪鞦韆，童心爆棚。</p><figure><img alt=\"楊卓娜與楊志翹拍拖去西藏。（IG@lennayeung）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260526/1136003176294780928420163.jpeg/lF6fck5Z_cWEBQYN2Hpbcs7A4R45qtLtFBz4zhQc-M4\"/><figcaption>楊卓娜與楊志翹拍拖去西藏。（IG@lennayeung）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"沿途落雪又見到羊。（IG@lennayeung）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260526/1136003173882925056497183.png/V_ctg39M_dZi2G5qj2wI-Qd9Kdotb2qGt3ArEbdwKxE\"/><figcaption>沿途落雪又見到羊。（IG@lennayeung）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"終於到啦！（IG@lennayeung）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260526/1136003171261353984496027.jpeg/GI0BRRAu70LVH3AvocLN_oL1DxK1VoxkGsfDphrHw6Y\"/><figcaption>終於到啦！（IG@lennayeung）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"好靚！（IG@lennayeung）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260526/1136003182221594624180624.png/L114WzpvGUWT1d3NXw8s1ut_s70YRLHSTU0-sk1NPrI\"/><figcaption>好靚！（IG@lennayeung）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"飲咖啡。（IG@lennayeung）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260526/1136003179767795712471835.jpeg/Xj1t1FTwqIYTvaRJq25KFuD9VcGltGanmoPwz5qD8M8\"/><figcaption>飲咖啡。（IG@lennayeung）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"盪鞦韆。（IG@lennayeung）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260526/1136003177368522752265304.png/fYizkTBo3WqCedVlXXI02bnTft2r99WlAJ6j1ACeo9Q\"/><figcaption>盪鞦韆。（IG@lennayeung）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"童心未泯。（IG@lennayeung）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260526/1136003174994415616538279.png/uRfzsXjKpLP3lzeMvPU8kO4mWz6eF6TrH4vKtR-LyrU\"/><figcaption>童心未泯。（IG@lennayeung）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"爽！（IG@lennayeung）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260526/1136003172624502784603719.png/U-ugF5n5i0R1woxLXPexIi-ErsP65cUqrtmiBK7ZogQ\"/><figcaption>爽！（IG@lennayeung）</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-05-27T03:20:35.915765+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":794,"images":13,"source":"HK01 娛樂","fallback":"none"}}